{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2020-11", "window": 3, "start_date": 1605484800, "end_date": 1606089599, "month_true_total": 136, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:59:26 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "79674197", "author": {"steamid": "76561198031536317", "personaname": "codyrgreene", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198031536317/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 739, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 672, "last_played": 1662693493, "avatar": "d8f44bd0c3c4d2d01c4532e899ca2c5c7b6fa528"}, "language": "english", "review": "Best game to make you feel like a Space Marine.", "timestamp_created": 1606071246, "timestamp_updated": 1606071246, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79664292", "author": {"steamid": "76561198011200931", "personaname": "fREDDO", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198011200931/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 518, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 518, "last_played": 1606057870, "avatar": "79d3fe5839617eb83a9661071ed021dd56ac8a5b"}, "language": "english", "review": "It´s honestly one of my favourite games!", "timestamp_created": 1606057960, "timestamp_updated": 1606057960, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79641590", "author": {"steamid": "76561197998471677", "personaname": "The Superior Siege Engine", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MrTrebuchet/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 357, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 357, "last_played": 1605409997, "avatar": "87101cf2ec83d19c28ae4459df7f786672e4a65a"}, "language": "english", "review": "I assume every 40K fan has already played this, but if you haven't/you're new to the universe, this game may not be what you're looking for. \n\nAt it's core, Space Marine wants to be a head-first action shooter set in 40K's grimdark universe. It gets close, but the game loop becomes really stale after the first hour. Difficulty comes from enemies becoming more bullet spongy, and hordes getting bigger. The chunky joy of smacking weapons into orks quickly falls to the side as more snipers and rocket launchers start spawning at the back of enemy packs, and what should be fast and visceral slows down to taking sniper shots before engaging in a hesitant melee while you wait for your ult to come back up. \n\nBosses that should be hard won yet satisfying fights end up just sending waves of mobs at you while you slowly chip away at a hidden health bar. All this leading up to a last hour of gameplay that might be the least satisfying final boss/story ending I've experienced in a while. \n\nSo yeah. If you're new to the fandom, go paint your minis instead. \n", "timestamp_created": 1606020401, "timestamp_updated": 1606020401, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.45628589391708374", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79626239", "author": {"steamid": "76561198102927987", "personaname": "The Philshaw", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "htt